title: The United Right's Social Fault Line
subtitle: Force PiS currents to choose between material concessions and a market-right veto.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: poland_negotiation_card
view-if: left_in_government = 0 and government_has_confidence = 1 and caretaker_government = 0 and government_party = "pis" and month_actions < max_month_actions and poland_pis_right_faultline_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; poland_pis_right_faultline_timer = 5
card-image: img/poland/cards/oversight-delivery.webp

= The United Right's social fault line

PiS can answer Lewica with transfers and state capacity, or answer
Konfederacja with market discipline and culture war. A public social amendment
would improve relations with one side of the governing camp by making the
other side record its dissent.

- @social_amendment
- @hearings
- @opposition_front

@social_amendment
title: Publish a wage-and-services amendment and dare PiS to divide
subtitle: Cost: 1 resource. Bargaining capital +6; solidarists move and the PiS right records its dissent.
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Drafting and monitoring the amendment requires one resource.
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources -= 1;
Q.government_negotiation_hostility -= 7;
Q.pis_negotiation_hostility_relief += 7;
Q.negotiation_capital += 6;
Q.pis_relation -= 1;
Q.pis_solidarist_share += 6;
Q.pis_market_hardliner_share -= 6;
Q.pis_accept_social += 7;
Q.pis_accept_market -= 4;
Q.ko_relation -= 3;
Q.p2050_relation -= 2;
Q.psl_relation -= 1;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 7;
Q.united_right_cohesion -= 7;
Q.progressives_dissent += 3;
for (const id of ["solidarna", "pis_security", "pis_culture"]) {
    const current = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
        return record.id == id;
    });
    if (current) {
        current.cohesion -= 4;
        current.grievance_memory += 10;
        current.defection_readiness += 3;
    }
}
const welfare = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
    return record.id == "pis_welfare";
});
if (welfare) {
    welfare.relation += 10;
    welfare.cohesion += 4;
}
Q.household_policy_pressure += 4;
Q.labor_credibility += 2;
Q.last_policy_stage = "Opposition amendment offered";
Q.last_policy_authority = "PiS cabinet and Sejm majority";
Q.last_policy_implementation = 0;
Q.news_headline =
    "A Left social amendment opens a fault line inside the United Right";
!}

The welfare current can defend the amendment as continuity with PiS social
policy. The sovereigntist, security and culture-war networks see a precedent
in which Lewica defines the governing camp's material agenda. Pressure rises;
implementation still belongs to the cabinet and Sejm majority.

- #poland_card_finish


@hearings
title: Put unions and service users before the committee
subtitle: Free. Bargaining capital +4 and governing dissent +5, but hostility +2.
on-arrival: {!
Q.government_negotiation_hostility += 2;
Q.pis_negotiation_hostility_relief -= 2;
Q.negotiation_capital += 4;
Q.pis_relation -= 1;
Q.pis_solidarist_share += 3;
Q.pis_market_hardliner_share -= 3;
Q.government_coalition_dissent += 5;
Q.united_right_cohesion -= 4;
Q.media_capacity += 2;
Q.labor_credibility += 3;
for (const id of ["solidarna", "pis_security", "pis_culture"]) {
    const current = (Q.rival_group_records || []).find(function(record) {
        return record.id == id;
    });
    if (current) {
        current.cohesion -= 2;
        current.grievance_memory += 6;
    }
}
Q.news_headline =
    "Committee testimony exposes the social divide inside the United Right";
!}

The hearings do not create cooperation. They make a market-right veto costly
and force the solidarists to decide whether they will defend their own record.

- #poland_card_finish


@opposition_front
title: Keep the dispute inside a common opposition front
subtitle: Do not cultivate a PiS faction. KO and the Third Way relations improve slightly.
on-arrival: ko_relation += 2; p2050_relation += 2; psl_relation += 1; pis_relation -= 2; progressive_credibility += 2; party_unity += 1; news_headline = "Lewica keeps the United Right's social dispute outside its strategy"

PiS resolves the argument internally. Lewica preserves opposition clarity and
surrenders a chance to influence which current wins it.

- #poland_card_finish
